### 16. Vercel Deployment Config is Broken
**File:** [vercel.json](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/vercel.json)

```json
{
  "rewrites": [
    { "source": "/api/(.*)", "destination": "/server/index.js" }
  ]
}
```

Vercel rewrites don't work this way for Express servers. Vercel requires serverless functions in `/api/` directory, or a custom build with `@vercel/node`. This `vercel.json` will result in **404 errors** for all `/api/*` routes when deployed to Vercel. The [DEPLOYMENT.md](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/DEPLOYMENT.md#L72-L78) claims Vercel support but it won't actually work.

