## 🟠 HIGH — Significant Logic / Architectural Issues

### 18. LocationModal "Auto-Detect" fakes geolocation
**File:** [LocationModal.jsx L30-43](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/src/components/LocationModal.jsx#L30-L43)

The "Use Current Location (Auto-Detect)" button always sets the location to Bangalore (`560001`) after a 600ms fake delay. It doesn't use the browser's `navigator.geolocation` API at all. The button says "Detecting GPS Location..." which is **misleading UX**.

