### 19. LocationModal fires API calls on every keystroke (no debounce)
**File:** [LocationModal.jsx L15-19](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/src/components/LocationModal.jsx#L15-L19)

```js
useEffect(() => {
  if (isOpen) {
    loadLocations(query);
  }
}, [isOpen, query]);
```

Every keystroke triggers a full `getLocations()` API call. There's no debounce, which will spam the server when users type quickly.

