### 21. `tatacliq` platform defined in server but has no scraper adapter
**File:** [index.js L151](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/index.js#L151) vs [adapters/index.js](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/services/adapters/index.js#L328-L335)

The `/api/platforms` endpoint lists 7 platforms including `tatacliq`, but only 6 adapters are registered (amazon, flipkart, croma, reliance, blinkit, myntra). Products with `tatacliq` platformId will fall back to `BasePlatformAdapter`, which will throw `"buildSearchUrl() not implemented"` if scraping is attempted.

