## 🟡 MEDIUM — Logic & Data Quality

### 24. Product IDs from scraping can collide
**File:** [universalSearchService.js L34](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/services/universalSearchService.js#L34)

```js
id: `scraped-${item.platformId}-${Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 7)}`
```

5-character random IDs have a collision space of ~60 million — but more importantly, the same product scraped twice will get **different IDs**, making deduplication and caching by ID impossible.

