## 🔵 LOW — Security, Performance, Accessibility

### 28. No email validation on server-side for price alerts
**File:** [index.js L157-161](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/index.js#L157-L161)

```js
if (!productId || !targetPrice || !email) {
  return res.status(400).json({ error: '...' });
}
```

The server only checks that `email` is truthy. No format validation — `email: "abc"` will be accepted. This is a data integrity issue.

