### 29. No ARIA labels / keyboard accessibility on interactive elements
**Files:** Multiple components

- Category pills, trending pills, platform pills — all use `<button>` but lack `aria-label` attributes
- Location cards use `<div>` with `onClick` — not keyboard navigable (no `role="button"`, no `tabIndex`, no `onKeyDown`)
- Modal close buttons lack descriptive `aria-label` (only `title`)
- The sort `<select>` has no associated `<label>` element (the `<span className="sort-label">` is visual-only)
- Scrape progress bar has no `role="progressbar"` or `aria-valuenow`

