### 30. Unbounded memory growth in `priceAlerts` array
**Files:** [index.js L25](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/index.js#L25), [priceHistoryService.js L1](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/services/priceHistoryService.js#L1)

Both `priceAlerts` arrays grow indefinitely with no cleanup, TTL, or max-size. In production, this is a memory leak that will eventually crash the Node.js process.

