### 31. SSE endpoint has no timeout — can hang indefinitely
**File:** [index.js L183-284](file:///c:/Users/Shikhar%20Mahajan/Documents/Project/Ekarters/server/index.js#L183-L284)

If all scraper adapters hang (e.g., due to DNS issues), `Promise.allSettled` at line 254 will wait forever. Individual scrapers have an 8-second timeout, but there's no overall request timeout for the SSE endpoint.

